Expose the column types of a converted Arrow schema

duckdb_schema_from_arrow resolves every column's DuckDB type, but the C API
offers no way to read them: a client had to convert a batch with
duckdb_data_chunk_from_arrow and inspect its vectors, which consumes data and
fails for a source without batches (an empty table). Add
duckdb_arrow_converted_schema_column_count / _column_type, which return the
resolved types directly.

Note for upstreaming: duckdb.h is generated from api_spec/v1 by capigen; this
patch edits the generated header directly. An upstream PR must add YAML
definitions and regenerate, plus tests.

